     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear geomorph community,<div><br></div><div>I am writing this message to say congratulations to Dr. Dean Adams for being awarded the well-deserved Rohlf Medal for Excellence in Morphometric Methods and Applications 2019. </div><div><br></div><div>Dr. Adams, thank you for your effort not only on co-develop the R-package geomorph, but also for your kindness, patience and willingness to respond and clarify our questions and doubts.</div><div><br></div><div>With kind regards,</div><div><br></div><div>Nicole </div></div><div><br> <table style=\"border-top:1px solid #d3d4de\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n      <td style=\"width:55px;padding-top:18px\"><a href=\"http://www.avg.com/email-signature?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=link&amp;utm_campaign=sig-email&amp;utm_content=webmail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.avg.com/email-signature?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dlink%26utm_campaign%3Dsig-email%26utm_content%3Dwebmail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484807709000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3dvMZzCpoghOFrcxkVt55e\"><img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/MoyILPaJZx6jUUqB9B1zExX4W9lxnsmQceeFFQSslT3u652-1zZbb1gOhiPP9rTHfyvM_Usz0rj1_YAB0_O0JhOMCliB-FAfZCvZ12J1mAuSOrHVizmlBtnBHFc=s0-d-e1-ft#https://ipmcdn.avast.com/images/icons/icon-envelope-tick-green-avg-v1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"29\" style=\"width:46px;min-height:29px\"></a></td>\r\n\t\t<td style=\"width:470px;padding-top:17px;color:#41424e;font-size:13px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:18px\">Libre de virus. <a href=\"http://www.avg.com/email-signature?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=link&amp;utm_campaign=sig-email&amp;utm_content=webmail\" style=\"color:#4453ea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.avg.com/email-signature?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dlink%26utm_campaign%3Dsig-email%26utm_content%3Dwebmail&amp;source=gmail&